# Optuna HPO Examples

Practical examples for running hyperparameter optimization with `optuna_hpo.py`.

## Example 1: Quick Test Run (5 trials)

```bash
python scripts/optuna_hpo.py \
    --n-trials 5 \
    --trial-epochs 5 \
    --limit-train 50 \
    --limit-val 5
```

## Example 2: Standard HPO Run

```bash
python scripts/optuna_hpo.py \
    --study-name standard-hpo \
    --storage sqlite:///optuna_standard.db \
    --n-trials 50 \
    --trial-epochs 20 \n    --limit-train 180 \
    --limit-val 20
```

## Notes

- Start with small settings first (5-10 trials).
- Keep `--storage` for long optimization runs.
- Set `--visualize-only` to regenerate HTML outputs from finished studies.
